// Per-level stat growth for Odin (levels 1-18).
// Level 1 equals the flat spec's BaseStats; each level adds the
// archetype-tuned growth below. Precomputed rows are provided so the
// balance/UI tools can read a table without recomputing.
ChampionScaling(
    slug: "odin",
    archetype: "mage",
    base: LevelStats(hp: 500, ad: 30, armor: 20, attack_speed: 0.75),
    per_level: StatGrowth(hp: 70, ad: 3.0, armor: 2.2, attack_speed: 0.018),
    levels: [
